  "title": "🇦🇸🇼🇸🇹🇰🇼🇫🇫🇯🇹🇻🇻🇺🇸🇧🇵🇬🇦🇺🇵🇼🇫🇲🇬🇺🇲🇵 Real Culture. Real Travel. READY!🎥🤙🏽 Pac...",
  "description": "🇦🇸🇼🇸🇹🇰🇼🇫🇫🇯🇹🇻🇻🇺🇸🇧🇵🇬🇦🇺🇵🇼🇫🇲🇬🇺🇲🇵 Real Culture. Real Travel. READY!🎥🤙🏽 Pacific Islands 2023-2024 is not just an ordinary trip, it’s 7 years of preparation for something bigger and greater that not even I could have imagined in the beginning. A trip canceled TWICE, but for a HUGE reason and I can now see why.  As a storytelling content creator who loves world culture as it were my own and for someone who strongly believes in respect in this day and age of toxic social media style travel, my pacific journey will entail me immersing, learning and becoming a part of these islands to respectfully share their stories in the way they deserve. From cultural dances, language , to the realities of climate change, and the faces of those many loving people who are open to share of their culture.   Everything in my life these past 7 years has aligned itself in a way, where I know exactly what I need to do and how I can lead an example, of the right foot print all travelers SHOULD leave behind in these places. It’s still quite the journey of planning , but will be 100 times more of a journey as it unfolds. Stay tuned voyagers, because I promise you, this will be a beautiful raw eye opener, of REAL PEOPLE. REAL CULTURE. REAL TRAVEL. 🤍🌴🤙🏽    #travel #pacificislands #polynesia #melanesia #micronesia #americansamoa #samoatiktok #tokelau #uveamofutuna #tuvalu #tuvalutiktok #fijitiktok #rotuma #vanuatu #solomonislandstiktok🇸🇧 #png #papuatiktok #torresstraittiktok #aboriginal #palautiktok #micronesiantiktok #yap #chuuk #kosrae #pohnpei #guam #guahan #saipan #cnmi ",
